# Cookie Policy

> **Draft Notice:** This template should be reviewed before publication.

_Last updated: August 2026_

## What Are Cookies?

Cookies are small text files stored on your device that help websites function properly and improve user experience.

## How We Use Cookies

Cookies may be used to:

- Maintain website functionality
- Remember user preferences
- Improve website performance
- Analyze website traffic

## Third-Party Cookies

Some third-party services embedded within the website may also set cookies according to their own policies.

## Managing Cookies

Most browsers allow you to control, block, or delete cookies through browser settings. Disabling cookies may affect certain website functionality.

## Changes to This Policy

This Cookie Policy may be updated periodically. Any updates will be posted on this page.

## Contact

If you have questions regarding our Cookie Policy, please contact us through our Contact page.
